# Smart Campus Lost & Found (MITS Gwalior) - Environment Configuration

# 1. Gmail SMTP Configuration (Deliver live OTP & Signup emails directly to student Gmail inboxes)
# Steps to get a 16-character Gmail App Password:
# 1. Open Google Account (myaccount.google.com/security) -> Turn ON 2-Step Verification.
# 2. Visit myaccount.google.com/apppasswords -> Create App "SmartCampus".
# 3. Copy the 16-character password and add these variables locally OR in Vercel Environment Variables:
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your_16_character_app_password
SMTP_FROM_NAME="Smart Campus Lost & Found - MITS"

# 2. Alternative: Resend HTTP API (Requires verified domain to email external students)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_resend_api_key_here
